---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
import MarketingChrome from "../../components/MarketingChrome.astro";

const phoneDisplay = "(501) 413-3386";
const tel = "tel:+15014133386";
const sms = "sms:+15014133386";
---

<Base
  title='Free Website Demo for Local Businesses | NV Labs'
  description='I build your local shop a free demo website first. See it, then decide. No obligation. Call or text (501) 413-3386 to get started.'
  image="/og.png"
  robots="index, follow"
>
  <MarketingChrome>
    <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
      <p class="eyebrow">Free website demo</p>
      <h1 id="hero-title">I'll build your website first. You decide after.</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        I'm Saad. I build a working demo of your site first. You see it, tap around on your phone,
        and then decide. No obligation.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-cta">
        <a class="btn btn-accent btn-lg" href={tel}>Call {phoneDisplay}</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost btn-lg" href={sms}>Text me</a>
        <a class="btn btn-text" href="/#work">Browse example demos</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="why-title">
      <h2 id="why-title">Why I do it this way</h2>
      <p>
        Hiring someone to build a website usually means paying up front and hoping it turns out
        okay. That never felt fair to me.
      </p>
      <p>
        So I flipped it. I build a working demo of your site first. You see it, tap around on your
        phone, and show it to whoever you want. Then you decide.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="steps-title">
      <h2 id="steps-title">How it works, step by step</h2>
      <ol>
        <li><strong>You call or text me.</strong> Tell me your business name and what you do.</li>
        <li><strong>You send me a few things.</strong> Nothing fancy (see the list below).</li>
        <li><strong>I build your demo.</strong> It's a real, working website with your info on it.</li>
        <li><strong>I send you the link.</strong> Look at it on your phone, your laptop, wherever.</li>
        <li><strong>You tell me what you think.</strong> I make changes until it feels right.</li>
        <li><strong>If you like it, I put it live.</strong> If you don't, you walk away. Simple as that.</li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="need-title">
      <h2 id="need-title">What I need from you</h2>
      <p>Most owners already have all of this on their phone:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Your business name, address, and phone number</li>
        <li>Your hours</li>
        <li>A list of your services, or your menu</li>
        <li>A few photos (phone photos are fine, or I can pull from your Instagram with your OK)</li>
        <li>Your logo, if you have one</li>
        <li>Anything you want customers to know, like "cash only" or "free parking out back"</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="noob-title">
      <h2 id="noob-title">No obligation, for real</h2>
      <p>
        There's no contract to see the demo and no card on file. If you look at it and it's not for
        you, that's the end of it. I'd rather earn your business by showing you something good than
        by talking you into it.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="who-title">
      <h2 id="who-title">Who this is for</h2>
      <p>
        I work with small local shops: bakeries, barbershops, panaderías, mobile mechanics, food
        trucks, salons, repair shops, and family-run places of all kinds. If you have customers in
        your neighborhood and no website (or one you're embarrassed by), this is for you.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="me-title">
      <h2 id="me-title">Who you'll be working with</h2>
      <p>
        Just me. NV Labs is a one-person shop based in Las Vegas. When you call or text, you're
        talking to the person actually building your site. I work with owners locally and remotely
        by phone and text.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="faq-title">
      <h2 id="faq-title">FAQ</h2>
      <div class="faq">
        <div>
          <h3>Is the demo really free?</h3>
          <p>
            Yes. Building the demo costs you nothing, and you're not on the hook for anything by
            looking at it.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>How long does it take to get my demo?</h3>
          <p>
            It depends on how quickly you can send your info and photos, but I move fast. Once I
            have what I need, I'll text you as soon as it's ready.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>What happens if I want changes?</h3>
          <p>
            Tell me. Most owners ask for a few tweaks, like a different photo or a reworded line.
            I'll keep adjusting until you're happy with it.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="cta-title">
      <h2 id="cta-title">Let's build your free demo</h2>
      <p>Send me your business name and I'll get started.</p>
      <a class="phone-big" href={tel}>{phoneDisplay}</a>
      <div class="hero-cta">
        <a class="btn btn-accent btn-lg" href={tel}>Call</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost btn-lg" href={sms}>Text</a>
      </div>
      <a class="back-home" href="/">Back to NV Labs home</a>
    </section>
  </MarketingChrome>
</Base>
